!-Generator IDFEditor 1.34
!-Option OriginalOrderTop UseSpecialFormat
!-NOTE: All comments with '!-' are ignored by the IDFEditor and are generated automatically.
!-      Use '!' comments if they need to be retained when using the IDFEditor.
!1ZoneUncontrolled_DDChanges.idf
! Basic file description:  Basic test for EnergyPlus.  No floor.  No roof.  No Windows Just 4 walls
!
! Highlights:              Illustrates Relative Humidity Schedules and Temperature Range schedules in
!                          Design Days -- also "DaySchedule:List"
!
!
! Simulation Location/Run: Denver Centennial Golden_CO_USA_WMO_724666, 4 design days, 1 run period,
!                          Run Control executes two design days (see RUN PERIOD object)
!
! Location:                Denver, CO
!
! Design Days:             Denver Centennial Golden_CO_USA Annual Heating 99%, MaxDB=-16°C
!                          Denver Centennial Golden_CO_USA Annual Cooling (DB=>MWB) 1%, MaxDB=32.6°C MWB=15.5°C
!                          Then, these design days with changes for relative humidity (schedule) and
!                          range changes.  Also the two design days are duplicated for the solar model:
!                          Zhang Huang aka IWEC2.  Then, the ability to add a Sky Temperature modifier is added.
!
! Run Period (Weather File): Full Annual Simulation, Denver Centennial Golden_CO_USA_WMO_724666
!
! Run Control:             No zone or system sizing, design day run control (no weather file simulation)
!
! Building: Fictional 1 zone building with resistive walls.  No floor.  No Roof.
!
!           The building is oriented due north.
!
! Floor Area:        232.26 m2 (user entered)
! Number of Stories: 1
!
! Zone Description Details:
!
!       (0,15.24,0)                 (15.24,15.24,0)
!              _____________________________
!             |                             |
!             |                             |
!             |                             |
!             |                             |
!             |                             |
!             |                             |
!             |                             |
!             |                             |
!             |                             |
!             |                             |
!             |                             |
!             |                             |
!             |                             |
!             |                             |
!             |                             |
!             |_____________________________|
!
!          (0,0,0)                      (15.24,0,0)
!
! Internal gains description:     NA
!
! Interzone Surfaces:             None
! Internal Mass:                  None
! People:                         None
! Lights:                         None
! Equipment:                      None
! Windows:                        0
! Detached Shading:               None
! Daylight:                       None
! Natural Ventilation:            None
! Compact Schedules:              NA (no schedules)
! Solar Distribution:             MinimalShadowing
!
! HVAC:                           NA
!
! Zonal Equipment:                NA
! Central Air Handling Equipment: No
! System Equipment Autosize:      No
! Purchased Cooling:              No
! Purchased Heating:              No
! Purchased Chilled Water:        No
! Purchased Hot Water:            No
! Coils:                          None
! Pumps:                          None
! Boilers:                        None
! Chillers:                       None
! Towers:                         None
!
! Results:
! Standard Reports:               Variable Dictionary, Surfaces (dxf), Meter File
! Timestep or Hourly Variables:   Hourly and Daily
! Time bins Report:               None
! HTML Report:                    None
! Environmental Emissions:        None
! Utility Tariffs:                None

